  ── Distribution Shape ──────────────────────
  Why: Skewness and kurtosis indicate departures from a normal (bell-shaped) distribution.
  Skewness            2.6503		Substantial right skew (|skew| < 2 is typically acceptable)
  Kurtosis (excess)   9.2608		Heavy-tailed (leptokurtic) (0 = normal; |excess| < 7 treated as typical)
